# Web3Auth (MetaMask Embedded Wallets) — client ID for social login.
# Create a project at https://dashboard.web3auth.io (EVM, Sapphire Devnet — free).
# The client ID is a public value, safe to expose.
#
# Leave this empty to use AvaKit's bundled demo key (works on localhost only) —
# set your own before deploying to a real domain.
#
# This template runs on Avalanche Fuji only (the eERC contracts it talks to live
# there — see CLAUDE.md), so there is no mainnet setup to do here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3AUTH_CLIENT_ID=
